hl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d18724b83eeefe2d8c2028ec930663ee/2023-11/lovegohome_119.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"好強勁嘅臂彎！！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ee2d77760b1474a54943bb1cbdda2a0/2023-11/lovegohome_209.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"李偉健的爆肌身形令人羨慕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e77febc272fdf37e8c1b763f9acb19aa/2024-01/liwaikinterryli_1699624833_3233009884479697578_2338467940.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劇組安排「怪雞Fanny」與「龍力王」Terry有感情線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eac84ffbd5ac5d7460629cdbe3a1a0e4/2023-10/001_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"效果出奇地討好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f12e8be6303f4538dbed2cc5c575d7d/2023-10/005_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民卻認為應該安排其他人與「Terry」組CP。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/545899279d66b0ed6afe10fe52aee609/2024-03/E-cPpldyQABF9BH9tzdqVuMcmCosEboAljEsLpYxLC4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩因拍攝《愛·回家之開心速遞》演「Bonnie」一角入屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e68cd17744df3cc716ec262d0cf76d2/2023-11/VS---myTVSUPER-1_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩在《愛．回家》飾演「譚道德」的女兒Bonnie。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa225fb34cf25c028b3785a558dc5d18/2022-10/lovegohome%20%281%29_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「安Bon」CP深受粉絲歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b94bf8625cfffe07151b766960c4c2b/2022-10/1_21.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩與「金城安」周嘉洛這對螢幕CP很受大眾歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3fe75e8b9c3e20452154c01a590a04ae/2023-11/VS---myTVSUPER-2_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\" 周嘉洛離開劇組，林凱恩拍有新情侶拍檔，與丘梓謙組成「蔥Bon」CP。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f39407fbeb50317f58ab4d985959b3cc/2022-10/4_15.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-12T05:19:24.972357+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":774,"images":93,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}